%% STM and checkpoint flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant CP as CheckpointStore
  participant C as Client
  O->>CP: save checkpoint
  O->>O: execute node
  O->>CP: save checkpoint
  O->>C: interrupt awaiting approval
  C->>O: resume with approval
  O->>CP: restore checkpoint
  O->>O: continue graph
  O->>CP: save checkpoint
